      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      88.75,
      242.45,
      378.95,
      268.67
    ],
    "text": "C.Government servants who enter into the gardens for official duties.D.Person who are granted free admission to the Director General.",
